title: answering under his note
pid: 28a91585-d7c2-43a0-8a14-35b782ea14c9
body: |2-
  Tried: answering "Need skg-diff mode from any view." by adding a child to it, inside Jeff's note on skg.
  Expected: my answer under his note, where he would meet it.
  Happened: the edit forked his note into my skgrepo. In my own views my fork now stands in his note's place, so I no longer see his note, only mine. In his views nothing changed, and nothing will until his config lists my skgrepo. Nothing told him I answered; for that I would have to write mail as well.
contains:
- 68989f41-ef5a-4ac9-a303-adc7aa9bcdb5
